WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.280
Fictional Charlaine proposes a trial: problem, change, owner, baseline, quality and review date. Permission is pending; she does not start.

2
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:26.340
Reprints: twenty per hundred before, five per hundred after; fifteen percentage points lower. The seventy-five percent relative reprint reduction proves neither cost savings nor cause.

3
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:37.160
No internet: propose a controlled approved paper master. Verify the version and seek feedback; team agreement has not been established.

4
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:45.420
Five sessions before, ten now. Reprint and quality data are missing. Do not guess rates or savings.

5
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:54.800
Propose a version check, owner, replacement, stock-gap contact and review. Confirm unknown fields.

6
00:00:55.100 --> 00:01:07.340
Dummy paperwork: feedback and retry. Peer or solo rehearsal is not trainer observation. Protect hand hygiene and timely service.

7
00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:23.880
Half the sessions were canceled, halving paper use: improvement is not established. Separate reprints from missing workload, quality and costs. Propose the master and handover, without claiming success or savings.
